// HistoricRosterPlugin content catalog.
// Car rules: the first matching rule with a "model" gives the AC folder of the real car; the first
// matching rule with a "url" (or "search") gives its download link. Put specific rules first.
// Track rules: first matching rule with a "folder" wins; a rule without folder only adds a link.
// The catalog only ever names the REAL car or circuit - never a look-alike.
// "kunos": true = official Kunos content -> players are sent to Steam instead of overtake.gg.
// Folder names marked kunos were checked against a real Assetto Corsa install.
// Mod folders (no "ks_" prefix, kunos false) are what was installed on the machine this was made on;
